# 2. Test Effort Estimation – WhatsApp “Send Message”

For a normal-sized messaging feature, I would estimate the testing effort like this:

| Test Activity                   | Estimated Hours |
| ------------------------------- | --------------: |
| Requirement understanding       |         2 hours |
| Test scenario preparation       |         2 hours |
| Test case design and review     |         5 hours |
| Test data preparation           |         2 hours |
| Test environment/device setup   |         2 hours |
| Functional test execution       |         6 hours |
| Compatibility testing           |         3 hours |
| Defect reporting and discussion |         2 hours |
| Retesting fixed defects         |         3 hours |
| Regression testing              |         3 hours |
| Test summary and documentation  |          1 hour |
| **Total Estimated Effort**      |    **31 hours** |

### Calculation

**Total effort = 2 + 2 + 5 + 2 + 2 + 6 + 3 + 2 + 3 + 3 + 1 = 31 hours**

So, I would estimate around **31 person-hours** for testing the Send Message feature.

